    excerpt: 'Anti-money laundering and counter-terrorist financing constitute a binding regulatory obligation for microfinance institutions (EMFs) in the CEMAC zone. This guide outlines the CEMAC Regulation No. 01/03 framework, operational requirements, and the distinct roles of COBAC, BEAC, and GABAC.',
