      'HOOK: A significant proportion of financial institutions in the UEMOA and CEMAC zones face compliance gaps with BCEAO and OHADA requirements. The consequences are measurable: blocked bank credit lines, ineligibility for IFC/BOAD/AfDB financing, blocked licensing files, and ESG-related exclusions. Compliance has ceased to be a regulatory burden. It has become a strategic access key to institutional financing.',

      'PROMISE: This guide provides the BCEAO and OHADA regulatory framework applicable to financial institutions and SMEs, the compliance requirements in force, and a 90-day action plan to structure your compliance approach.',

